WEBVTT

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:03.760
na kusogea zaidi ya maeneo yaliyojitenga
ambayo tunaishi, kila siku ya maisha yetu.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.360
Ninaamini

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:14.200
kua tunaweza kupata haya
kama tukiweka akili zetu

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.280
na matumaini kwenye tuzo.

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.120
Swali mbele yetu usiku wa leo

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.240
ni la muhimu sana.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:32.240
Nalo ni: "Unataka kupona?